Third-party data and assets
---------------------------

Worlds generated by Arnis are built from third-party data, and Arnis bundles
map assets and 3D models made by their authors. Each keeps its own license and
its attribution must be preserved.

The full list of sources, authors and licenses is kept in one place, so it does
not drift: open "License and Credits" in the app, or read src/gui/js/license.js.
